'''Thunderblood Atgeir''' is a version of [[Nord Atgeir]] upgraded with a [[Thunderblood Essence]]. It gains extra [[pierce]] and [[Lightning|lightning damage]], a 25% chance per hit to trigger [[Chain lightning]] and a 0.2% damage increase for every 1 point of [[health]] the player is missing.

* Its primary attack is a 3-stab combo with 2x damage on the last hit.
* The secondary attack is an AOE swing with a 3-meter radius that deals 1x damage and 6x stagger with no damage penalty against multiple targets.

An upgraded Nord Atgeir will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Thunderblood Atgeir.

